@startuml
title Flux de deploiement d une application

actor Admin
participant "gandal_deploy.py" as script
participant "API Kubernetes" as api
database etcd
participant Scheduler
participant Kubelet
participant Registry

Admin -> script : deploy alice memoire my-api

== Phase 1-4: Gouvernance ==
script -> api : Create Namespace
api -> etcd : Store
script -> api : Create ResourceQuota
script -> api : Create LimitRange
script -> api : Create NetworkPolicy

== Phase 5-7: Application ==
script -> api : Create Deployment (2 replicas)
api -> Scheduler : Schedule pods
Scheduler -> Kubelet : Start pod1
Scheduler -> Kubelet : Start pod2

Kubelet -> Registry : Pull image
Registry --> Kubelet : localhost:5000/my-api:v1

Kubelet -> Kubelet : Start containers

script -> api : Create Service (ClusterIP)
script -> api : Create Ingress (HTTP)

== Phase 8: Verification ==
script -> api : Wait for Ready
api --> script : 2/2 pods Ready

script --> Admin : URL: http://my-api-memoire-alice.16.170.20.250.sslip.io

@enduml
